<title>USA: Eyemakers CEO to resign as merger nears.</title>
<headline>Eyemakers CEO to resign as merger nears.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eyemakers Inc said on Monday that Wayne Allison will resign as chief executive and hand over the job to George Orm as the company merges with Budget Opticals of America.</p>
<p>The merger is set to close on Friday, August 22, 1997, Eyemakers said in a statement.</p>
